  "text": "Oncology | Metropolitan Veterinary Hospital\nSkip to Primary Content\nFind a Location\nEmergency\nEmergency\nInternships\nExternships\nResidency\nCareers\nAbout\nAbout Us\nAffiliated Partners\nNews & Blog\nAcademy\nMetroCares\nGood Samaritan Program\nContact Us\nOur Team\nAkron Team\nCleveland East Team\nAdmin Team\nView Full Team\nServices\nEmergency\nCritical Care\nAvian & Exotics\nBlood Bank\nCardiology\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nSurgery\nRadioactive Iodine Therapy (I-131)\nView all Services\nPet Owners\nPet Owners FAQ\nDocuments & Forms\nFor Veterinarians\nReferrals\nContinuing Education\nClinical Trials\nCurrent Clinical Trials\nPet Owner Information\nVeterinarian Information\nFind a Location\nEmergency\nOncology\nThis\nservice is offered at our Akron and Cleveland East locations.\nAt Metropolitan Veterinary Hospital, we have a team of board-certified oncologists who are equipped to provide comprehensive and compassionate care to each of our patients. Your pet’s comfort and quality of life are our focus, and our team will be with you every step of the way – from diagnosis to treatment and through any needed follow-up care.\nServices\nWe provide the latest diagnostic and treatment regimens, including:\nOxygen therapy\nBone marrow aspiration\nCT & other advanced imaging\nUltrasound\nChemotherapy options\nGenetic analysis for treatment plans\nElectrochemotherapy (at Cleveland East)\nGetting Treatment\nTo schedule an appointment, call our office at:\nAkron:\n(330) 670-2352\nCleveland:\n(216) 201-9842\nFor after-hours emergencies, call:\nAkron:\n(330) 666-2976\nCleveland East:\n(440) 673-3483\nWhat to Expect During My Pet's Appointment & FAQs:\nYou can view the forms in PDF format by downloading the free\nAdobe Acrobat Reader\n.\nOncology FAQs\nOncology Chemotherapy FAQs\nPet Owner FAQs – What to Expect\nCurrent Clinical Trials\nOur team is committed to bringing the highest level of medicine to our community, and we are excited to share the clinical trials available to our patients. Use the button below to access additional information:\nView Current Clinical Trials >\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nView all Services\nPet Owners\nFor Veterinarians\nLocations\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
